================================================================================
Third-party dependencies
================================================================================

ByeDPI links against, or is built with, the following third-party libraries.
Each remains under its own license; those licenses govern the corresponding
library, not ByeDPI's own source code.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
libnetfilter_queue
    Homepage: https://www.netfilter.org/projects/libnetfilter_queue/
    License:  GNU General Public License, version 2 (GPL-2.0-only)
    Used for: intercepting and re-injecting packets via the kernel NFQUEUE
              target. Also pulls in libnfnetlink (GPL-2.0) and libmnl
              (LGPL-2.1-or-later).

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GTK 4
    Homepage: https://www.gtk.org/
    License:  GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or later
              (LGPL-2.1-or-later)
    Used for: the graphical user interface toolkit.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
libadwaita
    Homepage: https://gnome.pages.gitlab.gnome.org/libadwaita/
    License:  GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or later
              (LGPL-2.1-or-later)
    Used for: the GNOME/Adwaita widgets and styling.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
libayatana-appindicator
    Homepage: https://github.com/AyatanaIndicators/libayatana-appindicator
    License:  GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or later
              (LGPL-2.1-or-later)
    Note:     ByeDPI implements the StatusNotifierItem tray protocol directly
              over GDBus and does not link this library at build time; it is
              listed here because ByeDPI targets the same freedesktop tray
              specification that libayatana-appindicator implements, and some
              desktop environments rely on it (or a compatible host) to display
              the tray icon.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GLib / GIO / GObject
    Homepage: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/glib
    License:  GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or later
              (LGPL-2.1-or-later)
    Used for: the DBus (GDBus) implementation behind the tray, main loop, and
              core utilities. Pulled in transitively by GTK 4.

================================================================================
Compliance note
================================================================================

Because libnetfilter_queue (and libnfnetlink) are distributed under the GPLv2,
any binary distribution of ByeDPI that links these libraries constitutes a
combined work whose distribution terms must be compatible with the GPLv2. The
Apache-2.0 license of ByeDPI's own source is compatible with GPLv3 but NOT with
GPLv2. If you redistribute pre-built ByeDPI binaries linked against these GPLv2
libraries, seek legal review or link against a GPLv2-compatible alternative.
Distributing ByeDPI's Apache-2.0 source code alongside these libraries as
separate components is not affected by this note.
